= Instructions

Add the @White rum{1 1/2 oz}, @Orange curaçao{3/4 oz}, freshly squeezed @Lime juice{3/4 oz} 
and @Orgeat{1/2 oz} into a #Cocktail shaker{} with crushed @Ice{} and shake lightly (about ~{3 seconds}).

Pour into a #Double rocks glass{}.

Float the @Dark rum{1/2 oz} over the top.

Garnish with a @Lime wheel{} and @Mint sprig{}.